<title>USA: Xomed Surgical Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Xomed Surgical Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.15		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			  1,087			301</p>
<p> Net sales		 17,804		   16,308</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,438		    4,617</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Xomed Surgical Products Inc.</p>
<p>1996 shr and net figures have been adjusted to reflect the company's acquisition of TreBay Medical Corp as if the acquisition had occurred on January 1, 1996.</p>
<p>They have also been adjusted to reflect the capital contribution of accrued cumulative preferred stock dividend in connection with the acquisition of TreBay and the exchange of certain shares of redeemable and convertible preferred stock for common stock.</p>
